{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2022-03-22 10:05:00', 'title': "NORTONLIFELOCK NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST TRUSTED COMPANIES BY NEWSWEEK", 'text': "TEMPE, ARIZ., MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORTONLIFELOCK (NASDAQ: NLOK), A GLOBAL LEADER IN CONSUMER CYBER SAFETY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED IN NEWSWEEK'S INAUGURAL LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST TRUSTED COMPANIES 2022 IN THE SOFTWARE & TELECOMMUNICATIONS CATEGORY."}